=== 3. gamma for general (J, g, ks): light sees n(1 + 1/(J g)); gamma = 1/(J g) = (c_matter/c_grav)^2 ===
J g = 1.00: (light potential)/(massive potential) = 2.0000 = 1+gamma, gamma = 1.0000
J g = 0.90: (light potential)/(massive potential) = 2.1111 = 1+gamma, gamma = 1.1111
J g = 1.10: (light potential)/(massive potential) = 1.9091 = 1+gamma, gamma = 0.9091

